{"path":"numeric/random/seed_seq","title":"std::seed_seq","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>seed_seq","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/numeric/random/seed_seq","section":"numeric","kind":"page","summary":"std::seed_seq consumes a sequence of integer-valued data and produces a requested number of 32-bit unsigned integer values, based on the consumed data.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/random\">&lt;random&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">class</span> seed_seq<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>std::seed_seq</code> consumes a sequence of integer-valued data and produces a requested number of 32-bit unsigned integer values, based on the consumed data. The produced values are distributed over the entire 32-bit range even if the consumed values are close.\n</p><p>It provides a way to seed a large number of random number engines or to seed a generator that requires a lot of entropy, given a small seed or a poorly distributed initial seed sequence.\n</p><p><a href=\"#\"><code>std::seed_seq</code></a> meets the requirements of <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/SeedSequence\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">SeedSequence</em></a>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Nested_types\">Nested types</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-hitem\">\n<td> Type\n</td>\n<td> Definition\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>result_type</code>\n</td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/integer\">std::uint_least32_t</a></span>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Data_members\">Data members</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-hitem\">\n<td> Member\n</td>\n<td> Description\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <span id=\"v\"></span><span class=\"t-dsc-small\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/vector\"><span class=\"kw1277\">std::<span class=\"me2\">vector</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>result_type<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></span> <code><i>v</i></code>\n</td>\n<td> the underlying seed sequence<br><span class=\"t-mark t-mark-expos\">(<span>exposition-only member object*</span>)</span>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Member_functions\">Member functions</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div t-dsc-member-nobold-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/seed_seq/seed_seq\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>(constructor)</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  constructs and seeds the <code>std::seed_seq</code> object <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator=</span></span></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-cmark\">[deleted]</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  <code>std::seed_seq</code> is not assignable <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/seed_seq/generate\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>generate</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  calculates the bias-eliminated, evenly distributed 32-bit values <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/seed_seq/size\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>size</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  obtains the number of stored 32-bit values <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/seed_seq/param\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>param</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  copies all stored 32-bit values <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cstdint&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;random&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">seed_seq</span> seq<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">4</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">5</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/vector\"><span class=\"kw1277\">std::<span class=\"me2\">vector</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/integer\"><span class=\"kw129\">std::<span class=\"me2\">uint32_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> seeds<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">10</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    seq.<span class=\"me1\">generate</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>seeds.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, seeds.<span class=\"me1\">end</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/integer\"><span class=\"kw129\">std::<span class=\"me2\">uint32_t</span></span></a> n <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> seeds<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1774\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> n <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>4204997637\n4246533866\n1856049002\n1129615051\n690460811\n1075771511\n46783058\n3904109078\n1534123438\n1495905678</code></pre> \n</div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Nested types","id":"Nested_types"},{"depth":3,"text":"Data members","id":"Data_members"},{"depth":3,"text":"Member functions","id":"Member_functions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"numeric","title":"Numerics library"},{"path":"numeric/random","title":"Pseudo-random number generation"}],"children":[{"path":"numeric/random/seed_seq/generate","title":"std::seed_seq::generate"},{"path":"numeric/random/seed_seq/param","title":"std::seed_seq::param"},{"path":"numeric/random/seed_seq/seed_seq","title":"std::seed_seq::seed_seq"},{"path":"numeric/random/seed_seq/size","title":"std::seed_seq::size"}],"map":{"label":"std::seed_seq","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11. std::seed_seq consumes a sequence of integer-valued data and produces a requested number of 32-bit unsigned integer…"},{"label":"Nested types","children":[{"label":"result_type","note":"std::uint_least32_t"}]},{"label":"Data members","children":[{"label":"std::vector<result_type> v","note":"the underlying seed sequence"}]},{"label":"Member functions","children":[{"label":"(constructor)","note":"constructs and seeds the std::seed_seq object"},{"label":"operator=","note":"std::seed_seq is not assignable"},{"label":"generate","note":"calculates the bias-eliminated, evenly distributed 32-bit values"},{"label":"size","note":"obtains the number of stored 32-bit values"},{"label":"param